{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Block Number 5",
    "steam_appid": 3328880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/7378f23e466bf2c2cd1cc2b28b7bd214.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/7378f23e466bf2c2cd1cc2b28b7bd214.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BN5 is the <strong>realest</strong> graffiti videogame. We are part of hip hop culture and every corner of the game it's filled with art from <strong>actual graffiti writers</strong> from all around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/3dfdffeb91ee7015558172009e8a1d6a.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/3dfdffeb91ee7015558172009e8a1d6a.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your unique graffiti style, combining letters, characters, symbols and even artwork from your favourite graffiti artists. The stylistic choices you'll take will have an impact on how <strong>the world reacts to you and your art</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/e3e7cc8bc2f722334b97944db431c16d.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/e3e7cc8bc2f722334b97944db431c16d.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Pyramid is a dystopic city divided in <strong>4 Blocks</strong> ruled by oppressors. The upper blocks even steal the sunlight from the lower ones, since the city is vertically built. <strong>From the sewers to the rooftops</strong> explore the Blocks and paint them..but watch out for the <strong>cops</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/11f8b40588cfe4f4cd144e8ed4dea4cb.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/11f8b40588cfe4f4cd144e8ed4dea4cb.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Paint your graffiti everywhere: the whole city is your canvas! But not only yours! The <strong>Graffiti Kings</strong> are known and respected in the streets, and they will not let you take their <strong>crowns</strong> easily. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/0c2bbf038c4af84be61dc547b1aada61.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/0c2bbf038c4af84be61dc547b1aada61.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Your path is in your hands: will you become a famous <strong>street artist</strong> or a wanted <strong>graffiti vandal</strong>? You will make yourself a name in the streets of Pyramid depending on your <strong>style</strong>, the spots you decide to paint, and your <strong>narrative choices</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/7378f23e466bf2c2cd1cc2b28b7bd214.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/7378f23e466bf2c2cd1cc2b28b7bd214.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BN5 is the <strong>realest</strong> graffiti videogame. We are part of hip hop culture and every corner of the game it's filled with art from <strong>actual graffiti writers</strong> from all around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/3dfdffeb91ee7015558172009e8a1d6a.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/3dfdffeb91ee7015558172009e8a1d6a.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your unique graffiti style, combining letters, characters, symbols and even artwork from your favourite graffiti artists. The stylistic choices you'll take will have an impact on how <strong>the world reacts to you and your art</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/e3e7cc8bc2f722334b97944db431c16d.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/e3e7cc8bc2f722334b97944db431c16d.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Pyramid is a dystopic city divided in <strong>4 Blocks</strong> ruled by oppressors. The upper blocks even steal the sunlight from the lower ones, since the city is vertically built. <strong>From the sewers to the rooftops</strong> explore the Blocks and paint them..but watch out for the <strong>cops</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/11f8b40588cfe4f4cd144e8ed4dea4cb.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/11f8b40588cfe4f4cd144e8ed4dea4cb.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Paint your graffiti everywhere: the whole city is your canvas! But not only yours! The <strong>Graffiti Kings</strong> are known and respected in the streets, and they will not let you take their <strong>crowns</strong> easily. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/0c2bbf038c4af84be61dc547b1aada61.poster.avif?t=1737889142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328880/extras/0c2bbf038c4af84be61dc547b1aada61.webm?t=1737889142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Your path is in your hands: will you become a famous <strong>street artist</strong> or a wanted <strong>graffiti vandal</strong>? You will make yourself a name in the streets of Pyramid depending on your <strong>style</strong>, the spots you decide to paint, and your <strong>narrative choices</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Conquer the streets as a real graffiti writer in Block Number 5, in this RPG Stealth Metroidvania the whole city is your canvas. Create your own style in our Graffiti Editor and parkour to spray it on the best street spots of Pyramid, but watch out for the cops!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
